flowchart TB
  accTitle: Connect Claude Code to the official GitHub MCP
  accDescr: Project .mcp.json configures the GitHub HTTP service, with a token supplied through an environment variable. Claude Code can read repositories or perform authorized actions. Check other MCP providers separately.

config["Project .mcp.json<br/>GitHub HTTP MCP"]
  token["GITHUB_PAT environment variable<br/>Grant the required repository access"]
  claude["Claude Code<br/>Check the connection with /mcp"]
  server["Official GitHub MCP<br/>api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/"]
  read["Read repositories and Issues<br/>Gather task context"]
  write["Write actions such as creating PRs<br/>Check permissions and authorization"]
  config --> claude
  token --> claude
  claude --> server
  server --> read
  server --> write
